    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilooti sha ng'wa Yosefu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo akikala mo ū mu sī ya Kanaani, ūmo wikalaga ū ise gītī nobeji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbū wene būsomboji bo mihayo ya būbyīle bo ng'wa Yakobo. Ū Yosefu aho alī nyanda wa myaka ikūmi na mpugatī, wadīīmaga ng'holo hamò nabo a bakūlūye, a bitūnja ba ng'wa Biliha na Zilipa, a bake ba ng'wa ise. Ūlū bīīta ya nkūlà wizaga wang'wīla ū saabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū Isilaeli walī antogilwe no ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yosefu kūtinda pye a bitūnja bakwe a bangī, nguno akabyalwa kū būnamhala bokwe; hūna lūūlū walī wameegeja ng'hanjo ya būlenji būsoga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakūlūye aho babona gīkī ū ise antogilwe kūbaheeba pye a boi, bakankolwa no; booya ū kūhooya nang'hwe mu mhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla waloota shilooti ikanza ilebe, aho wabalotoolela a bakūlūye bongeja ū kūnkolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabawīla gīkī, “Alidegelekagi shiishi shilooti naalootaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twalipaga ngano twajitunga miligo miligo, kwitulwa ū nigo gwane gwabūūka, gwīmīīla. Nī ying'we yūbūūka yīmīīla, hūna yūgūpīndya ū gwane, kūnū yagwinamīlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakūlūye būng'wīla, “Ū bebe ng'wenūyū hū ūkūbiza ntemi wise? Ūkūtūsuga gete ū bebe?” A henaho lūūlū hū bongeja ū kūnkolwa kūlwa nguno ya shilooti shakwe, nī yīyo akīhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūloota hangī shilooti shingī; nī shene ūbawīla a bakūlūye. Ūhaya gīkī, “Degelekagi shiishi shilooti shingī naalootaga. Ū lūkangala ūlū, ī līīmi nū ng'weji, hamò na sonda ikūmi n'īmò jalinamaga kū būtongi bone.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala kūbawīla a bakūlūye, ūng'wīla nū ise. Ū ise ūng'hama alīng'wīla, “Ū bebe obizagūloota shilooti kī shenīshi! Ū nene nū noko na a bakūlūyo tūkwinama gete kū būtongi wako kūshisha ha sī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakūlūye bakang'wītīla wilu no; alīyo ū ise ūgūtūūla mu ng'holò ū mhayo gwenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kūsīgwa na bakūlūye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a bakūlūye baalī lūgundīga mapandī ga Shekemu, bakūdīīmaga mitugo ja ng'wa saabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isilaeli ūng'wīla ū Yosefu, “Ūmanile gīkī a bakūlūyo baajile kūdīīma mitugo hihī na Shekemu, ali lūūlū natogilwe kūkūtūma ūje ko.” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Magatū baba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla gīkī, “Jaga ūkabalole a bakūlūyo, ūbone ūmo balījīla, nū mumo jilī ī mitugo; ūnenhela ī mhola jabo.” Ūntūma, kūfuma ūko yikalaga ī kaya; yalī kū ntubīlo gwa Hebuloni. Ū Yosefu aho washika ī Shekemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyūyeela yeela mu matogolo ga kwenūko akūbakoobaga; munhū nebe ūmanhya nang'hwe ūmūja, “Ūlīkooba kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Nalībakooba bakūlū bane, hamo ūdūgije kūniwīla ūko balījidīīmīla ī mitugo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla “Bīngile a henaha; nakabigwa baliwīla, ‘Tūjagi Dosani.’” Hūna ū Yosefu ūbakūūbīja a bakūlūye, ūūkabasangīla bbihī na Dosani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A boi aho banoleela kūle, ataalī ū kūshika aho baalī, bandya kūnsīga kūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biwīla, “Ūūyo washika ū wa mashilooti gakwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lelo tūmūlagagi, tūmponye ng'wikomelo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikomelo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikomelo, ichongo itaale hangī ishimu. Mu sī ja makoye ga minzī makanza gamò machongo ga mbika yenīyo gakasīmbagwa, kūlwa kūlang'hana minzī ga kūng'wisīja mitugo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tūkūja tūkahaye dūhū gīkī walyiwe līshiinū, tūbone ūko galakagelele a mashilooti gakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lubeni aho wabiigwa balīsīgana gīko ūgema kūmpīja; ūbawīla, “Bing'we tūtizūng'wīngīja ū būpanga bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizūgima kwita mininga gose gose; mponejagi dūhū ng'wikomelo līīlī aha, nguno nīyo kū matogolo kūle ū kūūnū.” Ū Lubeni akagūhaya ū gwenūyo nguno walī n'iganiko lya kūmpīja ū mu makono gabo, alanshoshe kūlī ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yosefu aho washika dūhū aho baalī, būnzuuja ī ng'hanjo yakwe, īyo yalī īsumilwe na būlenji būsoga, īyo walī azwalile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnsola būmponeja ng'wikomelo; gwike gaalī gaakama a minzī ū ng'wikomelo lyenīlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kūjinjiwa kū basūlūja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a boi bigasha kūlya shilīwa; kūbūūcha a miso, būbona nsūlūlū gwa Baishimaeli balīfuma Gileadi. Baalī na ngamīla jibūūkije miligo ya shisanjo sha mu shilīwa na maguta na būbbani, balīshitwala Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda ūbawīla a biye gīkī, “Ī gīsī ng'hana, tūkūpandīka solobo kī ūlū tūmūlaga ū nzuna wise hūna tūgabisa a mininga gakwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hambū hambū tūnjinjagi kū Baishimaeli babo; tūtizūng'wītīla yabūbi na makono gise. Nguno nīyo ī chene ū ng'wing'wana nzuna wise kamò; ū wei alī mīlī gwise na mininga gise gete.” Bizunīlīja nang'hwe a baana ba ng'wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a basūlūja a bana Midiani benabo aho bashika ho, a bakūlūye ū Yosefu būmfunya ū ng'wikomelo; būnjinja shekeli makūmi abīlī ja feza ū kū Baishimaeli benabo, būntwala kū sī ya Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lubeni wahayūshoka ū kwikomelo ūnsanga atīmo ū Yosefu, ūūtandūla shizwalo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūtandūla shizwalo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lūlī lūmeng'ho lwa koolekeja būpīna; makanza gamò būpelanu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūja ū kū bazunaaye alīhaya, “Bing'we naje he? Ū nyanda atīmo ū ng'wikomelo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlomana būsīnza mbūli, bīsola ī ng'hanjo ya ng'wa Yosefu bīdabbya mu mininga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'hanjo īyo yalī yawiza wiza yenīyo bītwala ū kūlī saabo; būūkang'wīla, “Twalī twīkūga ī ng'hanjo īyī. Īlolage hamo īdūgije kūbiza ng'hanjo ya ng'witūnja wako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīmana haho na haho; ūhaya, “H'ī ng'hanjo ya ng'wanone! Walyiwe mashiinū; tambala shilanga wasaasagūlilwe mashiinū ū Yosefu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūtandūla shizwalo shakwe ūzwala myenda ya magūnīla; ūnīla ū ng'witūnja wakwe shikū ningī no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bitūnja bakwe, na a bashīke bakwe būgema ū kūng'huumūja, alīyo būlemeelwa; nguno atazunije ū kūlūngūjiwa. Ūhaya, “Nilekagi ū nene, nakūcha nakūnīlaga ū ng'wanone, nankūūbīje ū mu shigila.” Ū ise akalīla no ī ng'hūngū, akūnīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bamidiani aho bashika ī Misili, būnjinja ū Yosefu ha ng'wa Potifali, ntūmami wa ng'wa Falao; ntaale wa balang'hani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37:36:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ntaale wa balang'hani:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gadūgije kūbiza ho makūlū ga; nang'hani ntaale wa jeela, nūūlū nang'hani ntaale wa bazugi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
